(7689792, 1260035, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is so lovely .. the little boy all joyful and running and his parents and sister .. i''m assuming .. smiling and laughing in the background .. perfect depth of field as well ... you have totally isolated your little subject to make him the focus of attention .. loving the black and white .. <br/>also loving the sister with her little foot raised and hand to her mouth .. and the pregnant mum with her hand on her tummy .. <br/>this is precious .. <br/>i have a feeling i know who took it too .. !! .. <br/>but i dont want to say in case i''m wrong .. ;)<br/>i''m not voting yet .. :)</td>', 'this is so lovely .. the little boy all joyful and running and his parents and sister .. i''m assuming .. smiling and laughing in the background .. perfect depth of field as well ... you have totally isolated your little subject to make him the focus of attention .. loving the black and white .. also loving the sister with her little foot raised and hand to her mouth .. and the pregnant mum with her hand on her tummy .. this is precious .. i have a feeling i know who took it too .. !! .. but i dont want to say in case i''m wrong .. ;)i''m not voting yet .. :)', '2021-03-19 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
