(7689854, 1260028, 65234, '<td valign="top">My kind of shallow DOF flower image :-) I like the composition and the bokeh. Light is a little flat but if this were standard editing I''m sure you could have easily fixed that.</td>', 'My kind of shallow DOF flower image :-) I like the composition and the bokeh. Light is a little flat but if this were standard editing I''m sure you could have easily fixed that.', '2021-03-19 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689855, 1259834, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like simple nature images. Just the two crisp leaves and some pretty shapes and light in the bokeh. Nicely composed (which is certainly part of the challenge of Minimal Editing!).</td>', 'I like simple nature images. Just the two crisp leaves and some pretty shapes and light in the bokeh. Nicely composed (which is certainly part of the challenge of Minimal Editing!).', '2021-03-19 15:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
