(7690316, 1260063, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic.  Shorebirds in silhouette at ocean''s edge.  And so beautifully attained.  The bokeh is stunning.  This is a silly question but, is it black and white?  It feels like there''s a whisper of blue around the circular bokeh, and some pink.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Classic.  Shorebirds in silhouette at ocean''s edge.  And so beautifully attained.  The bokeh is stunning.  This is a silly question but, is it black and white?  It feels like there''s a whisper of blue around the circular bokeh, and some pink.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-25 21:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690317, 1259924, 173844, '<td valign="top">A delicate jewel set upon a pillow of greens.  Such artistry never palls.</td>', 'A delicate jewel set upon a pillow of greens.  Such artistry never palls.', '2021-03-25 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690318, 1260035, 173844, '<td valign="top">Warmest, dearest entry of the challenge.  The people are perfect.  How the road winds away, sided by tall flowers, the whole also fading into the background, is artfully satisfying.  Totally charming.</td>', 'Warmest, dearest entry of the challenge.  The people are perfect.  How the road winds away, sided by tall flowers, the whole also fading into the background, is artfully satisfying.  Totally charming.', '2021-03-25 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690319, 1259987, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully cunning.  The ax fades from heavy, sharp tool along its length to a culminating splash of red and into a glorious pastel quilt of flowers.  This contrast is like pulling a rabbit from a hat.  Fine achievement.</td>', 'Wonderfully cunning.  The ax fades from heavy, sharp tool along its length to a culminating splash of red and into a glorious pastel quilt of flowers.  This contrast is like pulling a rabbit from a hat.  Fine achievement.', '2021-03-25 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690320, 1259940, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture in full flap, against a cloud-filled sky of geese.  Or a smattering of popcorn.  The sweep of dark feathers and orange beak and feet contrast pointedly against the rest.  The whole is like a flag with a central motif.  Well done.</td>', 'Terrific capture in full flap, against a cloud-filled sky of geese.  Or a smattering of popcorn.  The sweep of dark feathers and orange beak and feet contrast pointedly against the rest.  The whole is like a flag with a central motif.  Well done.', '2021-03-25 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690322, 1259813, 173844, '<td valign="top">Along with the sharp eye are the precise eyelashes.  Most all else is to play against this slender slice of depth and, as is intended, we''re drawn eye to eye.  Mesmerizing.<br/>Also, that candy pink nose is lovely.</td>', 'Along with the sharp eye are the precise eyelashes.  Most all else is to play against this slender slice of depth and, as is intended, we''re drawn eye to eye.  Mesmerizing.Also, that candy pink nose is lovely.', '2021-03-25 22:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690323, 1259927, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice portrait, but the composition seems awkward to me. There''s a pole coming out of the top of her head. The roof above her and the side of the building really don''t add much to the photo. I would have zoomed (or cropped) in quite a bit. The tips of her fingers around the pole look like they''re not attached to anything. She has such a nice smile -- just move in so much closer to get the focus on her.</td>', 'It''s a nice portrait, but the composition seems awkward to me. There''s a pole coming out of the top of her head. The roof above her and the side of the building really don''t add much to the photo. I would have zoomed (or cropped) in quite a bit. The tips of her fingers around the pole look like they''re not attached to anything. She has such a nice smile -- just move in so much closer to get the focus on her.', '2021-03-25 22:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690324, 1260003, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo, but the right 1/3 really doesn''t add much. It''s the main hair and the nice blurry mess to the left that''s interesting. I think the right side detracts too much -- making it seem less interesting than it actually is.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo, but the right 1/3 really doesn''t add much. It''s the main hair and the nice blurry mess to the left that''s interesting. I think the right side detracts too much -- making it seem less interesting than it actually is.', '2021-03-25 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690326, 1259775, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really nice how that singular thorn is caught against a background of lovely, complicated bokeh.  Like timorous balloons, or grapes to be skewered by toothpicks.  I admire this tiny bit of focus surrounded by all that living blur.</td>', 'Really nice how that singular thorn is caught against a background of lovely, complicated bokeh.  Like timorous balloons, or grapes to be skewered by toothpicks.  I admire this tiny bit of focus surrounded by all that living blur.', '2021-03-25 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
